    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36850" root="كرثأ" body-key="k">
    
      R. Q. 1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَرْثَأَ</span></b> , [inf. n, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَرْثَأَةٌ</span>;] and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تكرثأ</span></b> ;
[like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كرفأ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تكرفأ</span>;] <i>It</i> (hair, K, or a collection
of clouds, TA, &amp;c, K) <i>became large in quantity,</i>
(K,) <i>and intricate,</i> or <i>confused;</i> in the dial. of
the tribe of Asad; (TA;) <i>and heaped up.</i> (K.)

